        'in solve mode. On any non-zero exit, diagnose the first reported ' +
        'compiler or runtime error verbatim, fix only that cause, then ' +
        're-run the failing command before declaring completion. In ' +
        'release-only crashes, compare NDEBUG and optimization differences ' +
